```
$ jci-coverage upload -h
Upload a coverage report to OtterWise

Usage: jci-coverage upload [OPTIONS] --file <PATH>

Options:
      --file <PATH>         Path to the coverage report to upload
  -v, --verbose...          Increase logging verbosity
  -q, --quiet...            Decrease logging verbosity
      --repo-token <TOKEN>  Repository token
      --org-token <TOKEN>   Organisation token
      --endpoint <URL>      Override the upload endpoint (primarily
                            for testing)
  -h, --help                Print help (see more with '--help')

```
